    "title": "Authorities search for escaped inmate in Kalihi - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By HNN Staff ,\n7 hours ago HONOLULU (HawaiiNewsNow) - Authorities are searching for a 20-year-old inmate who escaped Wednesday morning from the Oahu Community Correctional Center (OCCC). The Honolulu Police Department received a report around 9:45 a.m. that Joseph Tauilemua had escaped. According to the Hawaii Department of Corrections and Rehabilitation, Tauilemua is a pre-trial felon... Read full article\n1",
